    ($SATQ$dba6a25a$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$05758-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Right triangles and trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 6, $SATQ$spr$SATQ$, $SATQ$<div xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1" class="stimulus_reference ">
