><path d="m345.49,115.31c.904,0,1.537.323,1.899.969.361.646.543,1.693.543,3.14v1.764c0,.75.051,1.324.154,1.725.026.091.194.178.504.262.311.084.53.126.659.126.039,0,.064.078.077.232.013.155.007.265-.019.33-1.293-.064-1.983-.097-2.074-.097-.026,0-.704.032-2.035.097-.052-.052-.077-.158-.077-.32s.025-.242.077-.242c.155,0,.372-.042.649-.126.278-.084.43-.171.456-.262.09-.375.135-.827.135-1.356v-1.938c0-1.202-.154-2.022-.465-2.461-.31-.439-.813-.659-1.512-.659-.413,0-.811.152-1.191.456-.382.304-.572.578-.572.823v3.411c0,.75.052,1.324.155,1.725.026.091.194.178.504.262.311.084.529.126.659.126.039,0,.064.078.077.232.013.155.007.265-.02.33-1.292-.064-1.983-.097-2.073-.097-.077,0-.782.032-2.112.097-.052-.052-.077-.158-.077-.32s.025-.242.077-.242c.155,0,.384-.042.688-.126s.469-.171.494-.262c.091-.375.136-.827.136-1.356v-3.663c0-.504-.09-.853-.271-1.047-.13-.155-.288-.262-.476-.32s-.342-.087-.465-.087-.184-.013-.184-.039c0-.31.038-.471.116-.484,1.369-.207,2.261-.375,2.674-.504.013,0,.045-.006.097-.019.052,0,.084.055.098.165.013.11.013.191,0,.242-.052.362-.078.62-.078.775,0,.052.013.077.039.077.013,0,.032-.013.058-.039.298-.31.701-.604,1.212-.882.51-.278.998-.417,1.463-.417Z" stroke-width="0"></path></svg><div role="region" aria-label="Long description for rectangle upper A upper B upper C upper D and rectangle upper Q upper R upper S upper T" class="sr-only"><ul><li>Rectangle upper A upper B upper C upper D is labeled as follows:<br>
