    ($SATQ$f1c1e971$SATQ$, $SATQ$0f1a7b12-733e-45ba-a7fc-021a951885f5$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$b870adfb-f433-4857-a880-b680da2d380b$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Circles$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The measure of angle <math alttext="upper R"><mi>R</mi>
</math> is <math alttext="StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction"><mrow>
